  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff &amp; Additions</a> 中的喷气背包和外骨骼添加了终局版本变体。</p>\n<p>下界合金变体的属性与普通的下界合金胸甲相同。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">*<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreateSA</a>&nbsp;和 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 为本模组运行所必需。</span></p>\n<p>本模组可自由用于任何整合包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>请在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-netherite-additions/comments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">评论区</a>&nbsp;或我的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aYycXd9XeJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 报告问题。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组也可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-netherite-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 获取。</p>",
